    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alehouse Tavern Simulator invites you into a vibrant fantasy world where your tavern is more than just a gathering place\u2014it's the heart of your adventure! As the tavern keeper, you\u2019ll manage daily life while diving into thrilling activities and exploring the magical surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish in nearby streams, hunt in the wilderness, tend to your small farm, raise pigs and chickens for fresh ingredients, and harvest vegetables from your own garden to craft delicious meals and brews that delight your patrons. Chop wood to fuel your kitchen and keep the tavern warm and inviting for your guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies won\u2019t always respect the peace of your establishment. Creatures may target your tavern, and you\u2019ll need to defend it. Take on quests, equip yourself with weapons, and protect your patrons and livelihood from harm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're whipping up a legendary stew, chopping wood like a lumberjack on a mission, or fending off bandits who clearly didn\u2019t read the \u201cno fighting in the tavern\u201d sign, Alehouse Tavern Simulator serves up endless charm and adventure. Will you become the kingdom's most beloved tavern keeper? Or will you just end up with a lot of angry chickens and broken mugs? The choice is yours\u2014pour yourself an ale and get to it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alehouse Tavern Simulator invites you into a vibrant fantasy world where your tavern is more than just a gathering place\u2014it's the heart of your adventure! As the tavern keeper, you\u2019ll manage daily life while diving into thrilling activities and exploring the magical surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish in nearby streams, hunt in the wilderness, tend to your small farm, raise pigs and chickens for fresh ingredients, and harvest vegetables from your own garden to craft delicious meals and brews that delight your patrons. Chop wood to fuel your kitchen and keep the tavern warm and inviting for your guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies won\u2019t always respect the peace of your establishment. Creatures may target your tavern, and you\u2019ll need to defend it. Take on quests, equip yourself with weapons, and protect your patrons and livelihood from harm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're whipping up a legendary stew, chopping wood like a lumberjack on a mission, or fending off bandits who clearly didn\u2019t read the \u201cno fighting in the tavern\u201d sign, Alehouse Tavern Simulator serves up endless charm and adventure. Will you become the kingdom's most beloved tavern keeper? Or will you just end up with a lot of angry chickens and broken mugs? The choice is yours\u2014pour yourself an ale and get to it!</p>",
    "short_description": "Alehouse Tavern Simulator invites you into a fantasy world where your tavern is the heart of your adventure! Fish, hunt, farm, and brew to serve your patrons. Defend your tavern from creatures, take on quests, and protect your livelihood. Adventure awaits!",
